$0$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $1$ | {{field-4}} | $1$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+6z=-1 \\\\ -2x+3y+0z=0 \\\\ x-9y+z=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316987/field-1" "q-316987/field-2" "q-316987/field-3" "q-316987/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316987"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316961/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "9dcae36b-dda8-54da-a399-069dd6c76bb5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316961/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "79a208fd-896a-5c77-9393-c375ef3c85f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316961/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "56ed2887-9165-5706-9184-ba7da9f01c75" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316961/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-316961/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2