" :answer-field/id #uuid "970c6af4-7012-57f7-86e2-84c2f843dfa9" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316983/field-4/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-316983/field-4/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316983" :question/id #uuid "421e7558-4703-5886-9be1-9f3cc9f19aeb" :question/math-academy-id "q-316983" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+z=1 \\\\ 3x-y+4z=8 \\\\ -4x+y+5z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $1$ | {{field-1}} | $1$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $1$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $3$ | $-1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $8$ |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} | $1$ | $5$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+z=1 \\\\ 3x-y+4z=8 \\\\ -4x+y+5z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316983/field-1" "q-316983/field-2" "q-316983/field-3" "q-316983/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316983"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection/2afc18bcf849ef7fe34efe2a25139e08b323a598b7865ccc27f9fb5f82349ad9" :answer/id #uuid "b5893f99-81c5-5686-b70f-8cb0d331ab51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection/e0c2006f69deda38ed7415f56124394c97d84cb4ebf96a9c1cb49aa0d978786d" :answer/id #uuid "5ff95514-3350-5e00-b4c5-13916f8593c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection/c8b72491590f357dc48aad84c2635d914daf24dc26834b2c60063338c7ed1b91" :answer/id #uuid "c9749fbc-d72d-5dcf-9730-3f1137de0196" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection/d7b4a8cf9ddf797d572c267881cf85d0e081dbd89cd9c801627d52d8383ff8ac" :answer/id #uuid "e96c0798-49ad-5fd7-8178-dab1cb6411f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection/9dff7ff2e303d39efac332586098a8b9cd9ca57c116e155ea1d67f69b4a80bae" :answer/id #uuid "8fbe0f41-adb7-54d0-b9da-6d7c04d5f815" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "15706fde-5495-5dbb-acd9-125e60ea3309" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75506/selection/9dff7ff2e303d39efac332586098a8b9cd9ca57c116e155ea1d67f69b4a80bae" :answer-field/choices ["q-75506/selection/2afc18bcf849ef7fe34efe2a25139e08b323a598b7865ccc27f9fb5f82349ad9" "q-75506/selection/e0c2006f69deda38ed7415f56124394c97d84cb4ebf96a9c1cb49aa0d978786d" "q-75506/selection/c8b72491590f357dc48aad84c2635d914daf24dc26834b2c60063338c7ed1b91" "q-75506/selection/d7b4a8cf9ddf797d572c267881cf85d0e081dbd89cd9c801627d52d8383ff8ac" "q-75506/selection/9dff7ff2e303d39efac332586098a8b9cd9ca57c116e155ea1d67f69b4a80bae"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75506" :question/id #uuid "d56da79a-73d5-5555-8061-ba75678fe9af" :question/math-academy-id "q-75506" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-y+z=1 \\\\ 2z+y+x=-1 \\\\ 3y-z+x=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & b \\\\ 1 & c & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}0x-y+z=1 \\\\ x+y+2z=-1 \\\\ x+3y-z=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=2,\\,c=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75506/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75506"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection/de10f8482d610224e40a09f8bc768ce86163921028cf5932071201cde2c19840" :answer/id #uuid "b342889e-bd35-5879-9627-85e1a25c1969" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection/e0fdbdaf745de5f38266002541d605e9407473fef17454d53f9f96b855858d85" :answer/id #uuid "21ee5e2f-0993-5436-bfc9-a5d1d239ecc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection/75d50ac3c24925eeff75d21d34cee6c25b753f04085943371fb66da64d60b75d" :answer/id #uuid "22e3dbe9-e5da-5528-ab60-5b64e7d8875b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-5,\\,b=-3,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection/67512c15b49683584a1945f1c07a388bb42c24723f7fb7428cef01238de5d145" :answer/id #uuid "39c2f160-bc4c-5776-861a-df33fafc6eda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection/441bd0fa86af26d7b766c854a03b35cf8ebf34cd4608d582249b6ae705dca9ad" :answer/id #uuid "ba9a8ba9-1bd5-5f68-b6cb-1f1e4215e723" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-3,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "64089744-0c3c-5609-9604-1ed6c4e789e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75509/selection/67512c15b49683584a1945f1c07a388bb42c24723f7fb7428cef01238de5d145" :answer-field/choices ["q-75509/selection/de10f8482d610224e40a09f8bc768ce86163921028cf5932071201cde2c19840" "q-75509/selection/e0fdbdaf745de5f38266002541d605e9407473fef17454d53f9f96b855858d85" "q-75509/selection/75d50ac3c24925eeff75d21d34cee6c25b753f04085943371fb66da64d60b75d" "q-75509/selection/67512c15b49683584a1945f1c07a388bb42c24723f7fb7428cef01238de5d145" "q-75509/selection/441bd0fa86af26d7b766c854a03b35cf8ebf34cd4608d582249b6ae705dca9ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75509" :question/id #uuid "ffe699fb-01ac-54c3-88e2-a1b2fa943327" :question/math-academy-id "q-75509" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2y-5x+3z=-1 \\\\ x-3y=3 \\\\ -3y+2z-x=-5\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & a & 3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & b \\\\ c & -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-5x+2y+3z=-1 \\\\ x-3y+0z=3 \\\\ -x-3y+2z=-5\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75509/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75509"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection/666a7b68ca3846ed8c2bb4fbe1fbdc95e176c1509a6c1dd5f489e671ba728d2c" :answer/id #uuid "ecb7ab6f-06dd-553d-9b4f-2bf3a5f15be8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=6,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection/6913d39d291e4e698f1ffe630c75b2ccd2d4eb87294c4e84295bca0375d63956" :answer/id #uuid "e811c971-b42b-57a3-8cfe-8df18a1e62a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=6,\\,c=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection/9f06f2b59bf89585d6fff3f437fb399b1cc1877ae2ebfbb3bdf2d07151145d24" :answer/id #uuid "934cae89-2696-517d-97d2-078985cb6ae6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=3,\\,b=-1,\\,c=-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection/a35fd5fa98a856ccac66685f625297d7ddd8803049c23e3fdf7f3c081f254759" :answer/id #uuid "9bd35db9-be56-57d7-945a-f5925f7091e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=6,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection/86d530210f4637c7006fe2c6b160aefe7a0463063514730fe9a485d7be1b22f4" :answer/id #uuid "e37462f9-8aaf-5338-a83e-a9cc52290547" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=2,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b5dbf484-058f-54ae-823c-b19172829282" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-9720/selection/a35fd5fa98a856ccac66685f625297d7ddd8803049c23e3fdf7f3c081f254759" :answer-field/choices ["q-9720/selection/666a7b68ca3846ed8c2bb4fbe1fbdc95e176c1509a6c1dd5f489e671ba728d2c" "q-9720/selection/6913d39d291e4e698f1ffe630c75b2ccd2d4eb87294c4e84295bca0375d63956" "q-9720/selection/9f06f2b59bf89585d6fff3f437fb399b1cc1877ae2ebfbb3bdf2d07151145d24" "q-9720/selection/a35fd5fa98a856ccac66685f625297d7ddd8803049c23e3fdf7f3c081f254759" "q-9720/selection/86d530210f4637c7006fe2c6b160aefe7a0463063514730fe9a485d7be1b22f4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-9720" :question/id #uuid "c19a6cb8-f905-5407-af86-886e3c517cbc" :question/math-academy-id "q-9720" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}y+2z-x=1 \\\\ 6y+3x-2z=2 \\\\ x+3z-y=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & b & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ c\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+6y-2z=2 \\\\ x-y+3z=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-1,\\,b=6,\\,c=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-9720/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-9720"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection/28587fbbdef072b4ef7e585e7a37bd8c493f5d794cc6dbce38062570d229d5dd" :answer/id #uuid "031eef6d-4a20-5f86-9d93-fbacd2a5e7b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=0,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection/88096993a5cefb206e6e013c4f2e9e6fc8af7824d3467dcddc091d47b434f8ef" :answer/id #uuid "c7ecbad9-d272-546a-8dd9-c59736456a30" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=0,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection/d038b772dc2954df7ed30d440842d0e0422f7ed0872821ffccb889cbf1b06bcb" :answer/id #uuid "ef458ff9-26f0-5ab6-add2-40b9f3417d31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection/d4486440026145908049144729c0d4f6ab8ebfdf883f522d1668f13380039638" :answer/id #uuid "979cf3b8-ed5c-537f-af19-1cec515dd31d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection/926e0d93d88112760243d53da8c4906f7d0d88f6f7e880067fe60b15dca25ec6" :answer/id #uuid "ae5c8a96-5bfe-5193-8464-cc3e4bf87209" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "15def9e3-2c68-561d-982f-2811fcc193bd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75500/selection/88096993a5cefb206e6e013c4f2e9e6fc8af7824d3467dcddc091d47b434f8ef" :answer-field/choices ["q-75500/selection/28587fbbdef072b4ef7e585e7a37bd8c493f5d794cc6dbce38062570d229d5dd" "q-75500/selection/88096993a5cefb206e6e013c4f2e9e6fc8af7824d3467dcddc091d47b434f8ef" "q-75500/selection/d038b772dc2954df7ed30d440842d0e0422f7ed0872821ffccb889cbf1b06bcb" "q-75500/selection/d4486440026145908049144729c0d4f6ab8ebfdf883f522d1668f13380039638" "q-75500/selection/926e0d93d88112760243d53da8c4906f7d0d88f6f7e880067fe60b15dca25ec6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75500" :question/id #uuid "b3e71ee9-4e24-52af-a780-70c10d095991" :question/math-academy-id "q-75500" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2y+3z=7 \\\\ x+z=-1 \\\\ 3z-2x+y=3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & b & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ c\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}0x-2y+3z=7 \\\\ x+0y+z=-1 \\\\ -2x+y+3z=3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=0,\\,c=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75500/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75500"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "3152052c-7362-5223-aca9-8a01e7e7f9b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "442afccf-24e4-5d09-93e5-c718143dd5e2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317632/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-317632/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "b9a28605-c9b8-5efa-afa6-187fc985a2fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "35b77f1d-87f0-5c45-b6d3-5c7dae154f18" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317632/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-317632/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c3286c20-7601-5ef5-bdef-b24bd472d849" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "e11516c6-d9ec-50fa-87c6-93648d7a0975" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317632/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-317632/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-4/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "9c2dcecf-d016-574a-86d8-44ea5655e5cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "300bcb4e-f3f8-5dbb-a6ad-e8a3a620fc02" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317632/field-4/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-317632/field-4/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317632" :question/id #uuid "5806b8d3-8c2c-520f-9045-92a3abcd749c" :question/math-academy-id "q-317632" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+4=7 \\\\ -2x+6z-1=8 \\\\ 7y-5z+2=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $5$ | {{field-1}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} | $6$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $9$ |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $7$ | $-5$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $-5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+0z=3 \\\\ -2x+0y+6z=9 \\\\ 0x+7y-5z=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-317632/field-1" "q-317632/field-2" "q-317632/field-3" "q-317632/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317632"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4518"] :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & b & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y+0z=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=6,$ $b=2,$ and $c=-2.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4519"] :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ z-x+2=-1 \\\\ 2y-2x-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & a & 1 \\\\ b & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ -x+0y+z=-3 \\\\ -2x+2y-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore $a=0,$ $b=-2,$ $c=-3.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
